('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',15,'{{diff:F000044,F000060}}',array['F000044','F000060']::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.table.rows.3.3'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','note',0,'Sources: <a href="https://www.les3vallees.com/en/skipass">Les 3 Vallées</a>, <a href="https://lesmenuires.com/en/ski-passes">Les Menuires</a>, <a href="https://guide-ski.fr/?p=1221">Guide Ski</a> for Méribel and <a href="https://www.alti-mag.com/tarifs-forfaits-de-ski/tarifs-forfaits-ski-alpes/tarifs-forfaits-ski-alpes-du-nord">Alti-Mag</a> for Val Thorens and Orelle. Courchevel''s own valley price is still being checked.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.table.note'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','heading',1,'What the pass covers','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.coverageTitle'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',16,'Linked both ways by lift and piste','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.coverage.0.label'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',17,'Courchevel','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.coverage.0.items.0'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',18,'La Tania','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.coverage.0.items.1'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',19,'Méribel','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.coverage.0.items.2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',20,'Saint-Martin-de-Belleville','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.coverage.0.items.3'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',21,'Les Menuires','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.coverage.0.items.4'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',22,'Val Thorens','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.coverage.0.items.5'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',23,'Linked by gondola, no piste home','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.coverage.1.label'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',24,'Brides-les-Bains, by the Olympe gondola','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.coverage.1.items.0'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',25,'Orelle village, by the Orelle gondola','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.coverage.1.items.1'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','heading',2,'Which pass for which trip','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.scenariosTitle'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',26,'A week in Méribel','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.scenarios.0.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',27,'The full pass costs {{diff:F000042,F000059}} more, and from Méribel every other valley is one to three lift rides away.',array['F000042','F000059']::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.scenarios.0.what'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',28,'A week in Les Menuires or Saint-Martin','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.scenarios.1.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',29,'The full pass costs {{diff:F000042,F000061}} more; Val Thorens is on both passes, Méribel and Courchevel only on the full one.',array['F000042','F000061']::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.scenarios.1.what'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',30,'A week in Val Thorens','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.scenarios.2.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',31,'The local pass covers Orelle and the highest lifts in the area for {{diff:F000042,F000064}} less.',array['F000042','F000064']::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.scenarios.2.what'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',32,'Families','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.scenarios.3.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',33,'The Family Flex pass charges every member the child price, {{f:F000046}} each for six days, for one or two adults with one to six children. Children under five ski free.',array['F000046']::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.scenarios.3.what'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',34,'Early and late season','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.scenarios.4.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',35,'From 5 to 18 December 2026 and 10 to 18 April 2027 the six day full pass falls to {{f:F000043}}, and the Les Menuires and Saint-Martin pass to {{f:F000062}}.',array['F000043','F000062']::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.scenarios.4.what'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',36,'Saturdays','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.scenarios.5.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','line',37,'A full pass day costs {{f:F000048}} when bought online by midnight on the Friday.',array['F000048']::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.scenarios.5.what'),
('area:les-3-vallees','pass','note',1,'Adults are 18 to 74, children 5 to 17 and veterans 75 and over, who pay {{f:F000047}} for six days at the ticket office only. High season runs from {{f:F000050|dm}} to {{f:F000051|dm}}.',array['F000047','F000050','F000051']::text[],'live','pilot import','pass.after'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','heading',0,'Getting there and choosing a base','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.h2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','para',0,'Geneva airport is about {{f:F000107|n}} to {{f:F000108}} from the main resorts by road, Lyon 170 to 200 km and Chambéry 90 to 120 km. The roads converge at the end, on the A43 to Albertville and the RN90 dual carriageway to Moûtiers, where the three valleys fork. The operator reckons on about two hours from Geneva or Lyon.',array['F000107','F000108']::text[],'live','pilot import','access.paras.0'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','para',1,'Moûtiers is also the railway station, around four and a half hours from Paris by TGV, and the Eurostar ski train from London stops there on winter Saturdays. From the bus station, coaches run up to Courchevel, Méribel, Brides-les-Bains, Les Menuires, Saint-Martin and Val Thorens for about {{f:F000114}} an adult, with {{f:F000115}} off when booked more than two days ahead, and the operator puts every resort within an hour.',array['F000114','F000115']::text[],'live','pilot import','access.paras.1'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','para',2,'Orelle is the exception. It lies on the far side of the ridge in the Maurienne valley, {{f:F000113}} from Geneva by the fastest road, and its gondola climbs straight into the Val Thorens ski area, a back door for anyone driving in from that side.',array['F000113']::text[],'live','pilot import','access.paras.2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','note',0,'Road distances are the fastest route by the OSRM router on OpenStreetMap data, without traffic or snow. Train and bus details as published by <a href="https://press.les3vallees.com/en/guide/getting-to-les-3-vallees">Les 3 Vallées</a> and its <a href="https://www.les3vallees.com/en/access-map/by-bus/from-moutiers/">Moûtiers bus page</a>; the Eurostar ski train as reported by <a href="https://www.seat61.com/trains-and-routes/eurostar-ski-train.htm">Seat 61</a>. 2026/27 timetables have not yet been checked.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.accessNote'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','heading',1,'How far each base reaches','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.basesH3'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','para',3,'Where a skier sleeps changes the holiday more than which pass they buy. Méribel and Mottaret sit in the middle, with Courchevel and Val Thorens two or three lift rides away. Les Menuires and Val Thorens are close to each other but far from Courchevel, {{f:F000182|w}} rides from the village lifts.',array['F000182']::text[],'live','pilot import','access.basesParas.0'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','para',4,'The corners pay for their charm or their price in lifts. Moriond, Brides-les-Bains and Orelle are each six lift rides from one end of the area, and a lunch on the far side can mean a long afternoon getting home.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.basesParas.1'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','caption',0,'Lift rides from each base','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.basesCaption'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',0,'To Courchevel 1850','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.baseCols.0'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',1,'To Méribel','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.baseCols.1'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',2,'To Val Thorens','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.baseCols.2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',3,'To a lift top above 2,800 m','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.baseCols.3'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',4,'Méribel-Mottaret','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.bases.0.base'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',5,'Méribel','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.bases.1.base'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',6,'Courchevel 1850','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.bases.2.base'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',7,'Les Menuires','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.bases.3.base'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',8,'Val Thorens','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.bases.4.base'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',9,'Courchevel 1550','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.bases.5.base'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',10,'La Tania','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.bases.6.base'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',11,'Le Praz','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.bases.7.base'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',12,'Saint-Martin','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.bases.8.base'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',13,'Moriond','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.bases.9.base'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',14,'Brides-les-Bains','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.bases.10.base'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','line',15,'Orelle','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.bases.11.base'),
('area:les-3-vallees','access','note',1,'Fewest lift rides from the village lifts before reaching the first lift of each area, on the OpenStreetMap model, allowing a gondola ride down where no piste returns and the walk from the Olympe gondola to the Chaudanne lifts in Méribel. Times are not included.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','access.basesNote'),
('area:les-3-vallees','snowboard','kicker',0,'Snowboarders','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.0.kicker'),
('area:les-3-vallees','snowboard','heading',0,'Riding the three valleys on a board','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.0.h2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','snowboard','para',0,'The operator counts {{f:F000029|w}} snowparks and {{f:F000030}} fun zones across the area. Méribel-Mottaret''s Open Park is the one for intermediate and expert riders, and this winter the Châtelet chair returns to join the lower and upper parts of the park. Courchevel''s Family Park starts beginners on small features, Méribel''s Bump''N''Jump runs from beginner to expert, Les Menuires has the Pixel Area for intermediates, and Val Thorens has the JF Chapuis skicross course.',array['F000029','F000030']::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.0.paras.0'),
('area:les-3-vallees','snowboard','para',1,'Drag lifts are the nuisance they always are, and they are not spread evenly. In the map data {{f:F000008}} of the {{f:F000007}} main lifts are drags, and they are thickest in Courchevel, where they make up about two in five of the lifts. In Les Menuires and Val Thorens fewer than one lift in six is a drag, which makes the Belleville valley the easier base on a board.',array['F000007','F000008']::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.0.paras.1'),
('area:les-3-vallees','snowboard','para',2,'Away from the parks, skiresort.com lists {{f:F000003}} of ski routes, marked but not groomed, and ranks the area among its best for freeriders and snowparks. Terrain beyond the markers is not controlled, so the avalanche bulletin and a local guide come first.',array['F000003']::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.0.paras.2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','snowboard','heading',1,'Parks and places to ride','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.0.listTitle'),
('area:les-3-vallees','snowboard','note',0,'Parks: <a href="https://www.les3vallees.com/en/activities/snowparks-and-fun-zones">Les 3 Vallées</a>; Châtelet chair: <a href="https://www.skiworld.co.uk/blog/?p=15672">Skiworld</a> and <a href="https://guide-ski.fr/?p=1221">Guide Ski</a>. Ski routes and ratings: <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/les-3-vallees-val-thorens-les-menuires-meribel-courchevel/">skiresort.com</a> and its <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/les-3-vallees-val-thorens-les-menuires-meribel-courchevel/test-report/">test report</a> (January 2025). Drag lift shares from OpenStreetMap. Park layouts change every season.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.0.note'),
('area:les-3-vallees','families','kicker',0,'Families','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.1.kicker'),
('area:les-3-vallees','families','heading',0,'Holidays with children','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.1.h2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','families','para',0,'Four of the resorts, Courchevel, Méribel, Les Menuires and Val Thorens, carry the Famille Plus label for family resorts, and skiresort.com counts families and beginners among the area''s strengths. The pass helps too: the Family Flex rate charges everyone the child price, and children under five ski free.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.1.paras.0'),
('area:les-3-vallees','families','para',1,'Courchevel does most for the very young. Its Village des Enfants at 1850 has its own lifts and conveyor belts, under threes can join BB Ski sessions, and the Aquamotion pool takes babies from six months and runs the Ludiboo Club for children of three to six.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.1.paras.1'),
('area:les-3-vallees','families','para',2,'Méribel has the Piste des Inuits, a run of games and slides for learners, the Yeti Park for younger children and a reindeer farm, the Ranch Nordique. Les Menuires adds an indoor Fun Park with zones for under threes, three to sixes and six to twelves, and the Boukty Snow Camp for igloos and snowball fights. Val Thorens has the Cosmojet, a sledging run of {{f:F000116}}.',array['F000116']::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.1.paras.2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','families','para',3,'For a base, Les Menuires has the highest share of green and blue runs of the big resorts in the map data and sits two lift rides from Val Thorens; Méribel and Mottaret put the most of the area within easy reach for parents who want a day further afield.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.1.paras.3'),
('area:les-3-vallees','families','heading',1,'Where children are looked after','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.1.listTitle'),
('area:les-3-vallees','families','note',0,'Sources: <a href="https://www.les3vallees.com/en/experiences/best-family-activities">Les 3 Vallées family activities</a>, <a href="https://www.les3vallees.com/en/new/kids-co">Les 3 Vallées children''s activities</a>, <a href="https://www.france.fr/fr/article/label-ski-famille-plus/">France.fr on Famille Plus</a> (updated October 2023), <a href="https://www.skipasscourchevel.com/en/skipass-prices-3-vallees">Courchevel lift passes</a> for the Family Flex rate. Ages and opening times are best checked when booking.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.1.note'),
('area:les-3-vallees','food','kicker',0,'Food','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.2.kicker'),
('area:les-3-vallees','food','heading',0,'Eating on the mountain','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.2.h2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','food','para',0,'On the operator''s count the area holds {{f:F000028}} Michelin stars across {{f:F000027}} restaurants. Courchevel has most of them, led by Le 1947 at the Cheval Blanc, where Yannick Alléno holds three stars, with two each at Beaumanière 1850 and Les Grandes Alpes. In Saint-Martin-de-Belleville, René and Maxime Meilleur keep two stars at La Bouitte, and the village also has the Bib Gourmand Simple et Meilleur.',array['F000027','F000028']::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.2.paras.0'),
('area:les-3-vallees','food','para',1,'Lunch on the slopes is easier to find than to choose, with {{f:F000026}} mountain restaurants among the {{f:F000025}} in the area. Le Cap Horn beside the Courchevel altiport has been open since {{f:F000117}}. La 1928 sits on the Col de la Loze with a heated terrace and a view all round, and Le Bel Air at the top of the Ariondaz gondola has a south facing terrace above Moriond.',array['F000025','F000026','F000117']::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.2.paras.1'),
('area:les-3-vallees','food','para',2,'The Belleville valley keeps more of the old farm food. Le Corbeleys at the top of the Saint-Martin gondola has been run by one family for over a century; Chez Pépé Nicolas, on the Chasse blue between Les Menuires and Val Thorens, makes its own cheese in summer; and Le Chalet de la Marine, off the Dalles blue above Val Thorens, is a fixture of the resort.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.2.paras.2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','food','heading',1,'Tables worth the detour','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.2.listTitle'),
('area:les-3-vallees','food','note',0,'Stars and Bib Gourmand: <a href="https://presse.explore-savoie.com/les-tables-distinguees-2026/">Savoie tourism, Michelin 2026</a>. Restaurant counts: <a href="https://press.les3vallees.com/en/guide/in-figures">Les 3 Vallées</a>. Mountain restaurants: <a href="https://www.les3vallees.com/en/experiences/restaurant-terraces-3-vallees">Les 3 Vallées terraces</a>, <a href="https://www.les3vallees.com/en/experiences/restaurants-with-festive-atmosphere">Les 3 Vallées festive restaurants</a> and <a href="https://www.skinewgen.com/ski-blog/ski-resorts/best-three-valleys-restaurants/">Ski New Gen</a>. Restaurants change hands and menus each season.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.2.note'),
('area:les-3-vallees','apres','kicker',0,'Après','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.3.kicker'),
('area:les-3-vallees','apres','heading',0,'Après and evenings','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.3.h2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','apres','para',0,'The loudest afternoons happen on the mountain. La Folie Douce has two branches here: one at the middle station of the Saulire Express above Méribel, with cabaret during lunch and electro after it, and one at the top of the Plein Sud chair in Val Thorens. Méribel also has Le Rond Point, known as the Ronnie, a ski in terrace known for its après and live music.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.3.paras.0'),
('area:les-3-vallees','apres','para',1,'Val Thorens keeps the party going longest. Le 360 Bar on the Combe de Thorens green brings in well known artists and hosts Festival''Tho, and in the village The Frog is described as the highest pub in Europe, while the Malaysia club stays open until four or five in the morning. In Les Menuires, Roc Seven, reached by the Roc 1 gondola, has DJs every afternoon, and the Chalet du Sunny has live music from two until half past four and snowcat rides up for Sunny Nights.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.3.paras.1'),
('area:les-3-vallees','apres','para',2,'Courchevel''s evenings move indoors. At 1850 Les Caves de Courchevel is the nightclub and La Mangeoire turns into a piano bar at night, and Moriond has the Fire & Ice bar at the Portetta, with fire pits and an ice bar.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.3.paras.2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','apres','heading',1,'Where the evenings start','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.3.listTitle'),
('area:les-3-vallees','apres','note',0,'Sources: <a href="https://www.les3vallees.com/en/experiences/restaurants-with-festive-atmosphere">Les 3 Vallées festive restaurants</a>, <a href="https://www.seemeribel.com/nightlife/apres/apres-ski-in-meribel">See Méribel</a> (October 2026), <a href="https://www.igluski.com/blog/post/best-apres-nightlife-val-thorens">Iglu Ski</a> (2023) and <a href="https://scottdunn.com/france/guides/courchevel-insiders-guide/bars-and-nightclubs">Scott Dunn</a>. Bars open and close from season to season.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','chapters.3.note'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','heading',0,'Who it suits','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.h2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',0,'How the area suits different kinds of trip, on the evidence gathered so far.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.intro'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',1,'Exploring a large network','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.0.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',2,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.0.fit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',3,'Six resorts share one network linked both ways by lift and piste, and from Méribel every valley is one to three lift rides away.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.0.why'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',4,'From the village of Moriond, Orelle takes {{f:F000218|w}} lift rides.',array['F000218']::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.0.limit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',5,'Intermediates who want variety','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.1.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',6,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.1.fit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',7,'No black run is needed between any two sectors, and green and blue reach them all in the map data.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.1.why'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',8,'The easy way round often costs one to three extra lift rides.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.1.limit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',9,'Groups of mixed ability','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.2.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',10,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.2.fit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',11,'From Mottaret every sector except Orelle is within two lift rides, so a group can split and meet again for lunch.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.2.why'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',12,'From Courchevel or Val Thorens the other end is a long day.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.2.limit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',13,'First timers','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.3.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',14,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.3.fit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',15,'Courchevel, Méribel, Les Menuires and Val Thorens hold the Famille Plus label, and skiresort.com rates the area highly for beginners.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.3.why'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',16,'The full pass is wasted on a first week; the valley passes cost {{diff:F000042,F000064}} to {{diff:F000042,F000061}} less.',array['F000042','F000061','F000064']::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.3.limit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',17,'Families','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.4.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',18,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.4.fit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',19,'Children''s villages, pools and fun zones in every big resort, Family Flex pricing and free skiing for under fives.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.4.why'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',20,'Prices for lessons and childcare vary by resort and are best checked when booking.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.4.limit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',21,'Snowboarders','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.5.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',22,'Mixed','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.5.fit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',23,'{{f:F000029|W}} snowparks and {{f:F000030}} fun zones, and few drag lifts in Les Menuires and Val Thorens.',array['F000029','F000030']::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.5.why'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',24,'About two in five of Courchevel''s lifts are drags.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.5.limit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',25,'Experts','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.6.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',26,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.6.fit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',27,'{{f:F000014}} black runs, {{f:F000003}} of ski routes and a top rating for experts and freeriders on skiresort.com.',array['F000003','F000014']::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.6.why'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',28,'Off piste terrain is not controlled; the avalanche bulletin and a guide come first.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.6.limit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',29,'Putting snow first','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.7.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',30,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.7.fit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',31,'{{f:F000022}} of the area is above 1,800 m, and Val Thorens and Orelle open first and close last.',array['F000022']::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.7.why'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',32,'At 1,600 m modelled snowfall has fallen, and four of the last five seasons were poor there.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.7.limit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',33,'Travelling without a car','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.8.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',34,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.8.fit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',35,'The Eurostar ski train and the TGV reach Moûtiers, and buses run from there to the main resorts within about an hour.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.8.why'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',36,'2026/27 timetables have not yet been checked.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.8.limit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',37,'Preferring a smaller area','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.9.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',38,'Mixed','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.9.fit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',39,'The valley passes cover Méribel, the Belleville valley or Val Thorens and Orelle on their own.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.9.why'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',40,'Even the valley areas are large; a small area elsewhere may suit better.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.9.limit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',41,'Food lovers','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.10.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',42,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.10.fit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',43,'{{f:F000028}} Michelin stars across {{f:F000027}} restaurants and {{f:F000026}} mountain restaurants.',array['F000026','F000027','F000028']::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.10.why'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',44,'The best known tables are expensive and book up.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.10.limit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',45,'Looking for après','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.11.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',46,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.11.fit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',47,'Two Folie Douce branches, Le Rond Point, Le 360 Bar and late clubs in Val Thorens.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.11.why'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',48,'Courchevel''s evenings lean to hotel bars and nightclubs rather than parties on the slopes.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.11.limit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',49,'Non skiers','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.12.who'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',50,'Mixed','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.12.fit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',51,'Aquamotion, the thermal spa at Brides-les-Bains, sledging runs and a pedestrian pass.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.12.why'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',52,'The pedestrian pass starts at {{f:F000049}}, and each activity is paid for separately.',array['F000049']::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.rows.12.limit'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','heading',1,'The catches','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.catchesH3'),
('area:les-3-vallees','fit','line',53,'The catches are about price and distance more than snow. The day ticket is the dearest of the four areas compared below, and the gap to the valley passes is small enough that most weeks end up on the full pass. The corners are a long way from each other: Moriond, Brides-les-Bains and Orelle are six lift rides from one end of the area, and Brides and Orelle depend on a single gondola each way. Lower down, the snow is thinner than it was, and four of the last five modelled seasons at 1,600 m were poor.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','fit.catches'),
('area:les-3-vallees','compare','heading',0,'The other large areas of Savoie','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','compare.h2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','compare','para',0,'Set against its neighbours, Les 3 Vallées is the biggest by a distance, with {{f:F000002}} of piste against {{f:F000071}} for Paradiski, the next largest, and about a quarter more lifts. It also has the dearest day ticket of the four, though its six day pass costs less than Tignes Val d''Isère''s.',array['F000002','F000071']::text[],'live','pilot import','compare.paras.0'),
('area:les-3-vallees','compare','para',1,'Tignes Val d''Isère climbs highest, to {{f:F000083}}, and has the most difficult skiing, a fifth of its piste. Paradiski is two big areas joined by the Vanoise Express cable car. Les Sybelles, in the Maurienne, is the cheapest by a wide margin, mostly red, and has the most modelled snowfall at 1,600 m, though it tops out at {{f:F000092}}.',array['F000083','F000092']::text[],'live','pilot import','compare.paras.1'),
('area:les-3-vallees','compare','caption',0,'Four linked areas of Savoie','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','compare.caption'),
