('area:les-3-vallees','compare','note',0,'Size, lifts, heights and grade split: skiresort.com listings for <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/les-3-vallees-val-thorens-les-menuires-meribel-courchevel/">Les 3 Vallées</a>, <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/la-plagne-paradiski/">La Plagne</a> and <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/les-arcs-peisey-vallandry-paradiski/">Les Arcs and Peisey-Vallandry</a> (added together for Paradiski), <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/tignes-val-disere/">Tignes Val d''Isère</a> and <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/les-sybelles-le-corbier-la-toussuire-les-bottieres-st-sorlin-st-jean-darves/">Les Sybelles</a>, retrieved 20 October 2026; Les Sybelles'' operator counts 310 km. Prices: <a href="https://www.alti-mag.com/tarifs-forfaits-de-ski/tarifs-forfaits-ski-alpes/tarifs-forfaits-ski-alpes-du-nord">Alti-Mag</a>, 2026/27 high season, indicative. Snowfall: ERA5 via the Open-Meteo historical weather API, one grid cell per area adjusted to 1,600 m; the cells are about 20 to 30 km across, so the figures describe regions, not single resorts. Road: fastest route from Geneva airport to the main villages by the OSRM router, leaving out Orelle at {{f:F000113}}.',array['F000113']::text[],'live','pilot import','compare.note'),
