('area:les-3-vallees','method','line',0,'Which resorts count','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','method.items.0.dt'),
('area:les-3-vallees','method','line',1,'The eight places reached on the 2026/27 Les 3 Vallées pass, counting Orelle and Brides-les-Bains; the operator counts seven resorts. Sharing the pass is recorded separately from being linked by lift and piste.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','method.items.0.dd'),
('area:les-3-vallees','method','line',2,'How links were checked','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','method.items.1.dt'),
('area:les-3-vallees','method','line',3,'A sector counts as linked only when a route of lifts and pistes reaches it in the OpenStreetMap data. Drag lifts run one way, gondolas may be ridden down, and the walk from the Olympe gondola to the Chaudanne lifts in Méribel is added by hand. A link is critical when closing one lift on it cuts routes that no other lift replaces. The model has not yet been checked against the official 2026/27 piste map.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','method.items.1.dd'),
('area:les-3-vallees','method','line',4,'Piste totals','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','method.items.2.dt'),
('area:les-3-vallees','method','line',5,'Operator and measured figures are both shown and never averaged. Mapped piste from OpenStreetMap is used only to compare resorts and grades.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','method.items.2.dd'),
('area:les-3-vallees','method','line',6,'Comparisons','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','method.items.3.dt'),
('area:les-3-vallees','method','line',7,'The four areas compared use the same source for each row, so a figure can be set against its neighbour.','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','method.items.3.dd'),
