('area:les-3-vallees','method','line',49,'Not shown on this page','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','method.fresh.10.1'),
('area:les-3-vallees','method','line',50,'Linked to operator and forecasters','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','method.fresh.10.2'),
('area:les-3-vallees','method','line',51,'Links checked 20 Oct 2026','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','method.fresh.10.3'),
('area:les-3-vallees','method','heading',0,'Figures that do not agree','{}'::text[],'live','pilot import','method.conflictsH3'),
('area:les-3-vallees','method','line',52,'The operator counts {{f:F000004}} lifts and skiresort.com {{f:F000005}}. The operator gives a base height of {{f:F000018}} and skiresort.com {{f:F000019}}, with the Olympe gondola starting at {{f:F000041}} in Brides-les-Bains. The operator counts {{f:F000024|w}} resorts, while the pass reaches eight places including Orelle. The elevation model puts the highest lift top at {{f:F000141}} against the operator''s {{f:F000020}}. skiresort.com gives the season as {{f:F000035|dm}} to {{f:F000036|dm}}, the dates for Val Thorens and Orelle; the linked area runs from {{f:F000033|dm}} to {{f:F000034|dm}}. This page names each source alongside its figure.',array['F000004','F000005','F000018','F000019','F000020','F000024','F000033','F000034','F000035','F000036','F000041','F000141']::text[],'live','pilot import','method.conflicts'),
('area:les-3-vallees','method','line',53,'Research of 20 October 2026. Size, runs, lifts, heights, restaurants and history: <a href="https://press.les3vallees.com/en/guide/in-figures">Les 3 Vallées in figures</a> and <a href="https://press.les3vallees.com/en/guide/our-story">the area''s history</a>. Measured size, grades, lifts and ratings: <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/les-3-vallees-val-thorens-les-menuires-meribel-courchevel/">skiresort.com</a>. Prices: <a href="https://www.les3vallees.com/en/skipass">Les 3 Vallées</a>, <a href="https://www.skipasscourchevel.com/en/skipass-prices-3-vallees">Courchevel lift passes</a>, <a href="https://lesmenuires.com/en/ski-passes">Les Menuires</a>, <a href="https://guide-ski.fr/?p=1221">Guide Ski</a> and <a href="https://www.alti-mag.com/tarifs-forfaits-de-ski/tarifs-forfaits-ski-alpes/tarifs-forfaits-ski-alpes-du-nord">Alti-Mag</a>. Season and new lifts: <a href="https://www.skiworld.co.uk/blog/?p=15672">Skiworld</a>. Network, bases, routes and lift heights: a graph of {{f:F000006}} lifts and {{f:F000009}} piste sections from <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap</a> (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL), with heights from the Copernicus 90 m elevation model via <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/elevation-api">Open-Meteo</a>. Snowfall: ERA5 reanalysis via the <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/historical-weather-api">Open-Meteo historical weather API</a> (CC BY 4.0). Road distances: <a href="https://project-osrm.org/">OSRM</a>. Facts from operators, measurements, model results and estimates are kept apart in the research files, and conflicting figures are listed above rather than averaged.',array['F000006','F000009']::text[],'live','pilot import','method.sources');
